      "summaries": {
        "en": "ClaudeCodeUI is an open-source web interface that enables developers to access AI coding assistants like Claude Code and Cursor CLI from mobile devices and browsers, solving the limitation of desktop-only tools. It works by providing a responsive GUI that connects to cloud-based AI services through APIs, allowing remote project management and session control. Developers can use it to code on-the-go, collaborate in distributed teams, or experiment with AI-assisted programming workflows without being tied to specific desktop environments.",
        "zh": "ClaudeCodeUI 是一个开源Web界面，让开发者能在手机和浏览器上使用Claude Code、Cursor CLI等AI编程助手，解决了这些工具仅限于桌面的问题。它通过响应式GUI连接云端AI服务的API，实现远程项目管理与会话控制，其移动优先设计体现了云原生开发工具的灵活性。开发者可用它随时随地进行编程、在分布式团队中协作，或探索AI辅助编程的新工作流程，特别适合需要移动办公或想尝试云端开发环境的用户。",
        "es": "ClaudeCodeUI is an open-source web interface that enables developers to access AI coding assistants like Claude Code and Cursor CLI from mobile devices and browsers, solving the limitation of desktop-only tools. It works by providing a responsive GUI that connects to cloud-based AI services through APIs, allowing remote project management and session control. Developers can use it to code on-the-go, collaborate in distributed teams, or experiment with AI-assisted programming workflows without being tied to specific desktop environments.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claudecodeui stands out for anthropic, anthropic-ai, and anthropic-claude in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "ClaudeCodeUI is an open-source web interface that enables developers to access AI coding assistants like Claude Code and Cursor CLI from mobile devices and browsers, solving the limitation of desktop-only tools. It works by providing a responsive GUI that connects to cloud-based AI services through APIs, allowing remote project management and session control. Developers can use it to code on-the-go, collaborate in distributed teams, or experiment with AI-assisted programming workflows without being tied to specific desktop environments.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/siteboon/claudecodeui for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
